    "id": "f50be359aa37fd4f4020ba8b9bcc945d2b39b382",
    "message": "#1342 WP1174-WINDOWS-BACKEND r2 (bac r1b): khoa + publish Windows dung rieng\n\nThem, DUNG RIENG (khong ham hien co nao goi toi, chua noi vao runtime):\n- _1174_win_api_ghi: bind them dung sau API kernel32 (LockFileEx,\n  UnlockFileEx, CreateHardLinkW, MoveFileExW, DeleteFileW,\n  GetHandleInformation) va cau truc OVERLAPPED.\n- _1174_win_lock: ban Windows cua _1174_lock (OPEN_ALWAYS tren chinh\n  reparse point, LockFileEx doc quyen chan toi khi co, doi chieu dinh\n  danh ten sau khi co khoa); ham khong decorator, context manager dung\n  ben trong than.\n- _1174_win_persist: ban Windows cua _1174_persist (create = hard link\n  khong ghi de; update = MoveFileExW REPLACE_EXISTING|WRITE_THROUGH;\n  doc lai dung bytes; chi don anh tam).\n\nTest: helper _additive1342r2 (N2, do mot lan luc PR, khong dang ky vao\nCASES), ca thuan wp1342_pure_lock_persist_refuse, chin ca native\nwp1342_native_lock_* / wp1342_native_persist_* (Linux: BO QUA, khong\ntinh dat). Khong doi MUTANTS, WP1174_REQUIRED, WP1174_BOTH; khong sua\nthan dinh nghia hien co nao.\n\nChua do: cac ca native tren Windows (phien dieu phoi do tren Desktop/VM).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Gtxrc92NsKt6FdYSseuTG",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-18T04:59:45Z",
